PEETO SAR AZADAARO MUSTAFA KA MATAM HAI <br>
GHAMZADA ISI GHAM SE AAJ SAARA ALAM HAI<br>
<br>
1. KEHRAHI HAI MAYYAT PAR ROOKE FATIMA ZEHRA <br>
 YUN NA JAO DUNIYA SE MUJHKO CHOR KE BABA <br>
 GHAM SE SHAHZADI KA KYA AJEEB ALAM HAI<br>
<br>
2. KHAK SAR PE DAALE HAI DEKHO SHABBAR O SHABBIR <br>
 AUR PAA CHADEY KHATI HAI GHAM SE ZAINAB E DILGEER <br>
 APNE NANA KA NOUHA UNKE LAB PE PAIHAM HAI<br>
<br>
3. ROONA PAYI JEE BHARKE HAYEH FATIMA ZEHRA <br>
 DIL PE SHAHZADI KE THA BOHAT BADA SADMAA <br>
 GHAM YATEEM HOONEY KA KYA BHALA KOI KAM HAI<br>
<br>
4. GHAR JALAYA ZEHRA KA HAYEH AHLEY BIDATT NE <br>
 BAAP KA DIYA PURSA BETI KO YE UMMAT NE<br>
 GHAM KA SILSILA PAIHAM FATIMA PE HAR DUM HAI<br>
<br>
5. AYE NAZAR KARO MATAM SARWAR E DO ALAM KA <br>
 HO ZUBAAN PAR NOUHA AB HUSSAIN KE GHAM KA <br>
 ZAKHME DIL KE ZEHRA KA BAS YEHI TO MARHAM HAI<br>
<br>
